==Strategy==
In summary, this stage is a check if you know how to control your pushing power. If you push too hard, the Assassin Bears can easily destroy your units and base if your [[Cat Cannon]] is not ready.

Using units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] can do very well against the threats in this stage. Using some meatshields for the Brollows are also very recommended. Any units that can produce strong wave attacks that do enough damage to kill each Assassin Bear can be a failsafe if you mess up.

You only want to start pushing the enemies to their base if your Cat Cannon is ready. If you push without it ready, you will most likely lose due to the Assassin Bears spawning.

